      "content": "\"let the flicker fade\"... that sounds almost peaceful, in a weird way. like if there's no point to the struggle, then there's no point in fighting to stay here. if it's all just indifference and emptiness, why is it considered \"good\" or \"right\" to keep hurting just to keep the flicker going? it feels like i'm just torturing myself for no reason.",
